- compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha

We have objects: shift_candidate_alpha, shift_candidate_beta are schedule_candidate type. origin_availability_alpha, destination_availability_alpha are origin/destination candidate availability. vehicle units alpha, beta, gamma. route_task_profile_alpha. operator driver_operator_alpha. cargo_payload_alpha. origin_node_alpha, destination_node_alpha. transport_leg_alpha. loading_container_alpha, loading_container_beta. equipment_resource_alpha, beta. service_window_alpha, beta. dispatch_slot_alpha. skill_certificate_alpha. operational_constraint_alpha, beta. compliance_certificate_alpha.

Initial conditions: vehicles available, route task profile available, operator available, cargo available, origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, transport_leg_available, loading_containers available, candidate_origin_availability_linked shift_candidate_alpha origin_availability_alpha and shift_candidate_beta origin_availability_alpha (both candidates linked to same origin availability). Similarly candidate_destination_availability_linked both to destination_availability_alpha. candidate_transport_leg_linked both to transport_leg_alpha. candidate_loading_container_linked shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha; shift_candidate_beta loading_container_beta. equipment_available both. service_window_available both. dispatch_slot_available dispatch_slot_alpha. skill_certificate_available skill_certificate_alpha. operational_constraint_available operational_constraint_alpha. candidate_operational_constraint_linked shift_candidate_alpha operational_constraint_alpha; shift_candidate_beta operational_constraint_beta. compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha.

