Thus to get loading_container_loaded we need transport_leg_assembled and transport_leg_loading_authorized.

Transport_leg_assembled can be done via assemble_transport_leg (requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available). Or other assemble_* variants that require certain nodes occupied/confirmed etc. But we likely need to lock origin and destination availabilities, confirm them, activate nodes, etc.

